# The release roots' image format (E2c), its one home (decision 0019): the base mounts these
# images, so the format is part of the base's ABI (debian/base-abi hashes these lines) and a new
# format, or new mksquashfs options, is a new base_abi that refuses every release ref sealed for
# the old one. Read by debian/base-abi and scripts/build_environment_image.py. Plain NAME=value
# lines, sh-quoted; appliance/apps/environment.py's IMAGE_SUFFIX, the Node's own copy, is held to
# IMAGE_SUFFIX by a test.
IMAGE_SUFFIX=.squashfs
SQUASHFS_OPTIONS="-noappend -no-progress -all-root -no-xattrs -comp zstd -b 128K"
